|-----------|---------------------|----------------------|--------------|
| 10,000 elements | 28.4 | 12.1 | 57.7% |
| 100,000 elements | 284.3 | 121.5 | 57.3% |

*Note: Benchmarks run on a modern CPU with 4 cores. The optimization reduces slicing overhead by 57% for typical use cases.*

